"课堂小结重申集合第一课为后续表示、关系和运算作准备，通过概念解读理解元素特征和概念学习方法。知识清单包括集合含义、特殊集合表示、有限集、无限集、空集、元素与集合关系及元素特征；思想方法为推理；素养为数学抽象、逻辑推理。","evidenceIds":["ev:final-omission:L001:summary-purpose-ending:b1"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceAnswerCompleteness":"given_source_steps_preserved"},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"课后练习用于总结知识与思想方法，能力拓展供学有余力者选做。结束语希望学生感悟概念形成和解读，既感到数学好玩也立志玩好数学；原文引用“书山有路勤为径，学海无涯苦作舟”，教师把“苦”改为“乐”，祝学生勤奋学习、收获快乐。其设计意图为融入学科德育，提升育人价值。","evidenceIds":["ev:final-omission:L001:summary-purpose-ending:b2"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceAnswerCompleteness":"given_source_steps_preserved"},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"源尾署名为上海市基础教育数字化转型项目组（高中数学），制作时间2022年。","evidenceIds":["ev:final-omission:L001:summary-purpose-ending:b3"],"wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceAnswerCompleteness":"given_source_steps_preserved"}],"contentOrigin":"source_based_reconstruction","wordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","titleWordingStatus":"editorial_normalized_title","sourceMethodNames":[],"matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"已对既有节点完整程序去重；仅补源题情境和具体步骤，不新增独立方法。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:final-omission:L001:summary-purpose-ending:b0","sourceId":"L001","sourceSha256":"07741f46039182b079e6703f3888f044284fb5b4f1715cd8d7beb06008e4bc5e","locator":{"headingPath":["第01课时 1.1集合初步（1）","例题设计意图、课堂小结、结束语"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":103,"supportingParagraphIndices":[103],"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":7,"supportingRenderedPages":[7],"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"通过具体实例巩固学生对集合含义以及元素与集合关系的理解，懂得有限集、无限集、空集的概念，能判断有限集、无限集和空集，","quoteRepresentation":"native_contiguous_text_run","quoteCompleteness":"原文字短片段；完整内容为另列的有源编辑重构，不冒充逐字引文。","transcriptionWordingStatus":"source_based_reconstruction","sourceSupportedTranscription":"例题1–3的设计意图为巩固集合含义与元素关系，理解并判断有限集、无限集、空集，提高用数学抽象思维思考和解决问题的能力。三例的完整题解分别映射旧example-1、example-2、example-3，不重复新增。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mat