ent":{"value":"通过实例了解集合含义，理解属于/包含/相等及并交补，能针对具体问题用符号语言和Venn图表达，了解全集/空集。","originalWording":"①通过实例，了解集合的含义，理解元素与集合的属于关系。\n②针对具体问题，能在自然语言和图形语言的基础上，用符号语言刻画集合。\n③在具体情境中，了解全集与空集的含义。\n理解集合之间包含与相等的含义，能识别给定集合的子集。\n①理解两个集合的并集与交集的含义，能求两个集合的并集与交集。\n②理解在给定集合中一个子集的补集的含义，能求给定子集的补集。\n③能使用 Venn图表达集合的基本关系与基本运算，体会图形对理解抽象概念的作用。","scope":"必修课程本条目内容对应：集合初步条目中原列概念、表示、基本关系和运算；仅对应所列部分，不表示其他课程类别的全员要求、学生达成或学业质量等级","status":"verified","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceEdition":"2017年版2025年修订（日常修订版）","evidence":[{"id":"ev:S2025:S25:S1","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceTitle":"2025数学课程标准（日常修订版）","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved","locator":{"part":"pdf","pdfPage":18,"printedPage":15,"headingPath":["必修课程","主题一 预备知识","内容要求","集合","集合的概念与表示"],"physicalTextLinesOneBased":[405,405]},"quote":"①通过实例，了解集合的含义，理解元素与集合的属于关系。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":false,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/b8bc8bc263faa68ddfc3275d.png","kind":"existing_local_original_pdf_page_preview","sha256":"b8bc8bc263faa68ddfc3275d40f045f04907347a61557d4ee748b610cb2d40a1","bytes":299404,"sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","localOrigin":"/Users/yichen.zhang/vibe coding/codex/projects/数学教育平台/math-network-site/r80/assets/b8bc8bc263faa68ddfc3275d.png","requestedPath":"S2025-PDF PDF page18 / printed15","pdfPage":18,"printedPage":15},"originalPdfUrl":"source-original/S2025-PDF.pdf","originalUrl":"source-original/S2025-PDF.pdf","verificationScope":"必修课程 complete original content clause, finite covered aspect; course category/optional-exam boundaries retained, no achievement or level inference.","sourceClauseId":"S1"},{"id":"ev:S2025:S25:S2","sourceId":"S2025-PDF","sourceTitle":"2025数学课程标准（日常修订版）","sourceSha256":"fc9258bb37ed2e052a4b1be608865a5481f770ae7e28ce536e835d2354353f86","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved","locator":{"part":"pdf","pdfPage":18,"printedPage":